<title>HUNGARY: Hungary MFB says opened representation in Brussels.</title>
<headline>Hungary MFB says opened representation in Brussels.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's state-owned development bank Magyar Fejlesztesi Bank Rt (MFB) opened a representative office in Brussels last Monday to promote Hungary's access to the EU, the bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The representation is designed to help those financial processes involved in integrating into Europe,&quot; MFB's CEO Andras Huszty told a news conference on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Emese Bartha, Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
